# The games library is local content, not source.
#
# Games are dropped in here at runtime — by the manager instance (999) writing
# a file, or by hand. They are deliberately NOT tracked: the library is whatever
# this machine happens to have. This .gitignore is the one tracked file in the
# directory, which is what keeps the directory itself in the repo so a fresh
# clone still has somewhere to put games.
#
# Vibe Blast is the exception and lives at the app root as a tracked file —
# it is the built-in, always-present game.
*
!.gitignore
